{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32856","headline":"送姚侍御充渭北掌书记 · 李频","name":"送姚侍御充渭北掌书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北境烽烟急，南山战伐频。\n抚绥初易帅，参画尽须人。\n书记才偏称，朝廷意更亲。\n绣衣行李日，绮陌别离尘。\n报国将临虏，之藩不离秦。\n豸冠严在首，雄笔健随身。\n饮马河声暮，休兵塞色春。\n败亡仍暴骨，冤哭可伤神。\n上策何当用，边情此是真。\n雕阴曾久客，拜送欲沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}